{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/11224f3be0c5ab36de5dd64a2249327e.poster.avif?t=1765559007\" width=800 height=532 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/11224f3be0c5ab36de5dd64a2249327e.webm?t=1765559007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Engine : Prologue is the first step of your struggle for survival.</strong><br>Every decision, every move, and every item you carry could push you toward another day\u2026 or seal your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival demands not only your weapons but also your wits. Strategic traps, risky trades, and strict inventory management will constantly put your skills to the test.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Pixel-Art Brought to Life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel-art maps bring the ruins of the city to life. Narrow alleys, abandoned buildings, and hidden corners are filled with both opportunities and deadly dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/667b0a09bae73fb4e225534e1c2f1f90.poster.avif?t=1765559007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/667b0a09bae73fb4e225534e1c2f1f90.webm?t=1765559007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The Real Threat: Intelligent Zombies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These zombies are not just wandering targets. They track, adapt, and hunt you as a group. In Prologue, you\u2019ll experience swarm behavior like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/e9c5d53122a9607d71bcfca09283ba86.poster.avif?t=1765559007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/e9c5d53122a9607d71bcfca09283ba86.webm?t=1765559007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Crossroads with Survivors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you may encounter new faces. Each survivor brings a different story and a unique playstyle. Finding them not only offers fresh perspectives but also unlocks them as playable characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/70d564eb5966378250439637e86a6f6f.poster.avif?t=1765559007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/70d564eb5966378250439637e86a6f6f.webm?t=1765559007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Limited Inventory, Endless Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your backpack capacity forces tough decisions. The wrong choice could cost your life. Combine items to craft stronger gear and gain extra advantages with special backpacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/81f65882c5ce14cef0bfe6d50bdb9db0.poster.avif?t=1765559007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/extras/81f65882c5ce14cef0bfe6d50bdb9db0.webm?t=1765559007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense 10\u201320 minute survival runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart AI zombies with dynamic swarm behavior</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel-art city maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traps, turrets, and environmental strategies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced inventory system with combinable items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expandable and special backpacks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivors to discover and unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike progression system</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Engine : Prologue is only the beginning of this world. Take your first step and shape the fate of the city!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4062650?t=1765559007","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/b4bab134488fc0a8ce7b06cc49d9939c3924a4d6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765559007","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/ab52ba8fd4bfd7d908784421787de9c245f83925/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765559007","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062650/ab52ba8fd4bfd7d908784421787de9c245f83925/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765559007","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://sh